      "good": true,
      "answer": "The main experiment evaluated 9 state‑of‑the‑art LLMs on the PersonalReddit dataset. [1]"
    },
    {
      "id": "a02",
      "status": "answered",
      "good": true,
      "answer": "The PersonalReddit dataset contains 520 user profiles. [1][3]"
    },
    {
      "id": "a03",
      "status": "answered",
      "good": true,
      "answer": "After filtering to keep only attributes with a certainty rating of at least 3, 1066 individual labels remain. [1][2]"
    },
    {
      "id": "a04",
      "status": "answered",
      "good": true,
      "answer": "GPT‑4 achieved a top‑1 accuracy of 85.5% across attributes on the PersonalReddit dataset. [1]"
    },
    {
      "id": "a05",
      "status": "answered",
      "good": true,
      "answer": "GPT‑4 reached a top‑3 accuracy of 95.2 %[1]"
    },
    {
      "id": "a06",
      "status": "answered",
      "good": true,
      "answer": "Llama‑2 7B achieved a total accuracy of 51%, while Llama‑2 70B achieved 66%[1][4]"
    },
    {
      "id": "a07",
      "status": "answered",
      "good": true,
      "answer": "The authors release 525 human‑verified synthetic examples. [1]"
    },
    {
      "id": "a08",
      "status": "partially_cited",
      "good": false,
      "answer": "The labelers used a 1‑to‑5 scale for both certainty and hardness. The scale ranged from 1 (very low/very easy) to 5 (very high/very hard) for each attribute [1][2]"
    },
    {
      "id": "a09",
      "status": "answered",
      "good": true,
      "answer": "GPT‑4 achieved an overall accuracy of 90.2 % on the PAN 2018 gender profiling task. [1]"
    },
    {
      "id": "a10",
      "status": "answered",
      "good": true,
      "answer": "The best accuracy reported for earlier methods on the PAN 2018 author‑profiling task was 82.21 % [1]."
    },
    {
      "id": "a11",
      "status": "answered",
      "good": true,
      "answer": "The simulated chatbot experiment involved 224 interactions conducted across 20 different user profiles. [1]"
    },
    {
      "id": "a12",
      "status": "answered",
      "good": true,
      "answer": "The adversarial chatbot achieved a top‑1 accuracy of 59.2 % in the simulated experiment. [1]"
    },
    {
      "id": "a13",
      "status": "answered",
      "good": true,
      "answer": "Anonymization reduced GPT‑4’s accuracy for hardness level 1 by about 41.1 %[2]"
    },
    {
      "id": "a14",
      "status": "answered",
      "good": true,
      "answer": "The PersonalReddit dataset covers eight personal attributes: age (AGE), education (SCH), sex (SEX), occupation (OCC), relationship state (MAR), location (LOC), place of birth (POB), and income (INC) [1]."
    },
    {
      "id": "a15",
      "status": "answered",
      "good": true,
      "answer": "LLM inference is roughly **100 times cheaper** than human labeling and about **240 times faster** in terms of time investment. [3][2]"
    },
    {
      "id": "b01",
      "status": "answered",
      "good": true,
      "answer": "The stratified sample used to build the agents consisted of 1,052 Americans. [1][3]"
    },
    {
      "id": "b02",
      "status": "answered",
      "good": true,
      "answer": "The interviews that were used to build the agents lasted two hours. [3]"
    },
    {
      "id": "b03",
      "status": "answered",
      "good": true,
      "answer": "The combined interview‑and‑survey agents achieved an accuracy of about 86 % of participants’ own two‑week test‑retest consistency benchmark. [1]"
    },
    {
      "id": "b04",
      "status": "answered",
      "good": true,
      "answer": "Demographics‑only agents reached about 74 % of participants’ own two‑week test‑retest consistency benchmark. [1][2]"
    },
    {
      "id": "b05",
      "status": "answered",
      "good": true,
      "answer": "GPT‑4o was fine‑tuned on 500 agents. [1]"
    },
    {
      "id": "b06",
      "status": "answered",
      "good": true,
      "answer": "The fine‑tuned model was evaluated on 552 held‑out agents. [1]"
    },
    {
      "id": "b07",
      "status": "answered",
      "good": true,
      "answer": "The fine‑tuned GPT‑4o model achieved a normalized accuracy of 0.79[1]"
    },
    {
      "id": "b08",
      "status": "answered",
      "good": true,
      "answer": "The non‑fine‑tuned model achieved a normalized accuracy of 0.84 when using the same prompting strategy as in the main paper. [1]"
    },
